  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "1e5b5fa7-4516-431b-9992-752ef587864a",
    "name": "TomTom Traffic Traffic Tiles API",
    "description": "The TomTom Traffic API provides real-time traffic data for developer applications. The Traffic Incidents service delivers accurate information about traffic jams, accidents, road closures, and hazards. The Traffic Flow service provides observed speeds and travel times for key roads, updated every minute. Supports raster and vector tile formats for map display.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: TomTom Developer Support",
